                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nelotu ororei lo Laitoriani enatii aajoki: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani, impirare oldoinyo le Seir, nimbonoki aarare ninye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nijoki ninye, Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ing'ura ajo, kaarare iyie oldoinyo le Seir, naa kaaitorioki enkaina ai aarare iyie, naa kaaidapash iyie naaidaikie naitaa ene pesho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaidaikie inkanas inono niaku iyie mitil; ina pee iyiolou ajo ara nanu Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu inyor iyie emang'atisho e anaake, ninchoo lelo tung'ana le Israel engolon o lalem te nkata e ngolikinoto enye, te nkata e mutata enye nabayie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "metaa, ore anaa enaishu nanu ejo Olaitoriani Enkai, ekarreten intae te nkaraki osarge naa kesuj intae osarge; amu irara intae arruok te nkaraki osarge, metaa kesuj intae osarge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaitaa oldoinyo le Seir olemetii toki, naitaa mitil; naa kadung'oo te ninye lelo pooki oopuonu atua aaparan nepuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaiput ildoinyo linyi lmpopoki; o too ndoinyo inyi o too nong'ot inyi o iyarat o lashepak linyi pooki kebatata nena pooki to lalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitaa intae mitili anaake, ore inkanas inono nemeitokini aamany. Ina peyie iyiolou ajo ara nanu ilo Aitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore amu itejo, ‘Ore kulo oshon pokira o kuna kuapi pokira naa keaku inaainei, naa aikintaa ninche inkunaang,’ ore hoo netii apa Olaitoriani ine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku, ore anaa enaishu nanu, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai, ekaitaas intae anaa enatiu engoro o enkiba nintodolua te nkaraki enkiba aarare ninche; naa kaitayiolo nanu kewan tiatua intae, ina kata naiguanare intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa iyiolouu aajo nanu, Olaitoriani otoning'o nena baa pooki torrok nitejo iararere lelo doinyo le Israel, ijojo, ‘Eitaaki ninche mitili, eishooki iyiook maidakie.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nirupurupu intae ate oleng kiararere nanu too nkutukie inyi, niponaa irorei aitaa kumok kiararere nanu; natoning'o nanu ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore tenkaraki enchipai enkop pooki ekaaitaa iyie mitil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore anaa enitishipakine ina jung'o enkaji e Israel, amu aimitil apa ninye, neaku kaarare sii nanu iyie; iaku sii iyie mitil, oldoinyo le Seir, o Edom pooki, pooki elulung'a. Ina peyie eyiolou ninche aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
